お願いします。\n\nヤモリ／男／19歳\n飄々として胡散臭い情報屋\n\n【台詞一覧】\n▼仲間加入時\n「お初にお目にかかります。俺はヤモリ。贔屓して下さいね。」\n▼拠点画面\n「うはは、噂話はだぁい好きですよ。俺は食いますけどね。夫婦喧嘩。」\n▼パーティイン\n「ひらりと参上。さてと行きますか！」\n▼戦闘開始\n「お護り致しますよ、お嬢さん。……なんてね！」\n▼敵挑発\n「こっちおいでェ。」\n▼ボス発見\n「動きも弱点も、丸見えですよォ。」\n▼勝利\n「俺は最初っから信じてましたとも！」\n▼撤退\n「おっとこりゃマズい…。それではドロン！」\n\nhttps://twitter.com/shushirotte/status/1283432325670252545?s=21", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@woool1029/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 136140, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/26899/0/vtt/0.vtt?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1781940336&Signature=HzFKGlZDrxng4c1bHr5CLFf9N866WVeFbZPAd7bDeyd~U~Tf8ikpvc9A1IV~7M7WTnVCSHsM9DhSVOdEzkjNkjosP3wPNgCLb-sAbIkTL6YpBBBGpFv3qXfOLoyFYZfODJBE~D4Mx55AQahVCRFuCHSgN05~EBqxsGXHcdaLEJiVXa0O0xZ9zMROc8i8rBBr6AgbjGA6vaWDJ2xiwNh5qqNaXBVuKOUCz4B3NYleSUUR8x~LK2oDDoHKTccP4~WdXTbtBjN5Vghhva37WZ1uuP3btNv7GKnuXIS5lT9DSPlLmh~8lAQrYyl64mogFJZ2KrZpaD5FTc0-mbct9Rbp8g__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=496aa1eafd2672ec9cf9225f13a2f027", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=496aa1eafd2672ec9cf9225f13a2f027, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d081bd0b41a2d8c1513f7d350f82192 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1377653244290236434%2FOvj42I2a.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9e420d04032